5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about the time the treasurer spends. Can we keep it simple?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to know the actual costs first. Guessing is not an option.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,Agreed. But we must ensure the fee does not scare off new members.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I feel the hesitation in the room. We need to make joining effortless.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let’s look at who actually shows up. The data will tell the truth.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, yes. If fewer people come, the burden on the books grows heavier.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, exactly. We must cover the fixed costs regardless of attendance.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,We should check the ledger to see where the money actually went.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I want to see why people are hesitating. The social vibe is fading.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the attendance records. I suspect the core group is doing all the work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,The ledger seems essential. I hope it shows a manageable workload.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the ledger and the bank statements. I need hard numbers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the sign-up records. I need to see how newcomers integrate.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the winter social notes and the sign-in sheets. I need to feel the mood.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will examine the rota and the attendance record. I need to see the imbalance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will look at the ledger and the treasurer’s hours. I want to understand the pain.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look at the ledger and the bank statements. I need to verify the income.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will look at the sign-up records and the taster forms. I need to see the barrier.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I will look at the winter social notes and the sign-in sheets. I need to see the hesitation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the rota and the attendance record. I need to see who is carrying the load.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
